      "body": "## Motivation\n\n`test_shared_expert_routing_extra.py::TestSelectExpertsPerRankSharedSlots.test_routes_like_no_fusion` fails before routing because its EP=8 override leaves TP=1, violating `tp_size == moe_ep_size * moe_dp_size * moe_tp_size`.\n\nObserved in [PR Test Extra on #44977](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39394810488/job/118535400304). The failing test comes from main, introduced by #44913.\n\n## Modifications\n\nApply a minimal version of the test-topology fix in #44994 so it can land independently of the broader MoE refactor. Model rank 3 of TP=EP=8 by setting TP, attention-TP, and EP sizes/ranks together. This test initializes no communication groups; the existing default DP/CP/MoE-TP widths remain 1.\n\nOnly `test/registered/moe/test_shared_expert_routing_extra.py` changes.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\n- Targeted CPU smoke check using the actual `ParallelContext` and `_validate_parallel` definitions extracted from source: the original override reproduces the CI error; the patched override passes topology validation and restores the previous state on exit.\n- `pre-commit run --files test/registered/moe/test_shared_expert_routing_extra.py` passes.\n- Python syntax and `git diff --check` pass.\n- Full CUDA routing tests have not been run locally (no CUDA environment); CI validation is still required.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNot applicable: test configuration only.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #39453583354](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39453583354)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #39453583076](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39453583076)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #39453583215](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39453583215)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end 